    "detailed_description": "Play with friends<br>- Uncrowned is fully co-op up to an unlimited amount of players. The game is currently balanced around 4 player co-op having more players may lead to unintended outcomes.<br><br>Start from nothing<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Uncrowned is all about turning yourself from an unknown sailor to a well respected noble or pirate.<br><br>Colonize<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Found new colonies and grow them.<br></li><li>Manage buildings and what goods you want to make.<br></li><li>Manage different types of residents and seek new colonists.</li></ul><br>Combat<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ship to ship combat<br></li><li>Different ammo types</li></ul><br>Living world<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>AI merchants travel and trade, protected by naval ships, hunted by pirates<br></li><li>In depth sailing/wind mechanisms<br></li><li>Dynamic trade systems</li></ul><br>However you choose to venture Uncrowneds vast ocean just remember to pay your taxes!<br><br>Uncrowned is a solo developed game from assets to code.</li></ul>",
